a0_DE = 9.3619e-11   a0_RAR band 1.2000e-10-1.2457e-10   deep-end a0_eff 1.080e-10-1.100e-10 (x1.1536-1.1750 a0_DE, G167/G193)
the loop: a0 -> RAR fit (n(a0), deep exponent 1-n/4) -> shape-lock gamma=(2+n)/n (H055)
          -> profile -> distribution dM/dg ~ g^(2/(1-gamma)) = g^-n -> Lomax kernel shape n
          -> kernel fit (a0 free) -> F(a0);  fixed point a0* = F(a0*).

